==========================================================
WHY THIS STACK
==========================================================

Next.js

Provides modern frontend architecture, server-side rendering support when needed, excellent routing, and scalability for enterprise applications.

NestJS

Offers a modular backend architecture using dependency injection, making the codebase clean, testable, and suitable for large ERP systems.

PostgreSQL

Provides strong ACID compliance, advanced relational capabilities, high performance, and excellent support for reporting and transactional systems.

Prisma ORM

Ensures type safety, easy schema management, and maintainable database access.

Firebase Authentication

Provides secure authentication with minimal setup while allowing PostgreSQL to remain the system of record for business data.

Redis

Improves application performance by caching frequently accessed data and managing background queues.

BullMQ

Handles background tasks such as email notifications, report generation, scheduled jobs, and audit processing.

