==========================================================
DATABASE ARCHITECTURE
==========================================================

This ERP must use PostgreSQL as the primary relational database.

The database should follow proper normalization (3NF where appropriate) while balancing performance.

Design the schema with future scalability in mind.

Every table must include standard audit fields:

- id (UUID)
- created_at
- updated_at
- deleted_at (Soft Delete)
- created_by
- updated_by
- status
- version

Never use integer IDs for public APIs.
Always use UUIDs.

